# Pin line endings so a build is reproducible from a CLEAN CHECKOUT, not merely
# repeatable inside one working tree.
#
# This existed as a real hole: the published bundle was verified by building
# twice in the same tree, which cannot detect this class of difference. Working
# files were LF while a clean archive materialized CRLF, and because the browser
# bundle ships UNMINIFIED, that difference survives into the output - different
# bytes, different content hashes, different asset filenames. The provenance
# claim ("any machine can rebuild from this commit and diff") was therefore
# false as stated. Found by reviewer-a, 2026-08-09.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.7z binary
*.zip binary
